#: feedback.py:30
msgid "What did you learn from this? What was missing?"
msgstr "Qu&#39;avez-vous appris de cela ? Qu&#39;est-ce qui manquait ?"

#: feedback.py:31
msgid "How would you rate this as a learning experience?"
msgstr "Comment évalueriez-vous cette expérience d&#39;apprentissage ?"

#: feedback.py:33
msgid ""
"Think about the material, and try to synthesize key lessons learned, as well"
" as key gaps in our presentation."
msgstr ""
"Réfléchissez au contenu et essayez d&#39;en tirer les principaux "
"enseignements, ainsi que les principales lacunes de notre présentation."

#: feedback.py:37
msgid ""
"Take a little bit of time to reflect here. Research shows that a meaningful "
"synthesis will help you better understand and remember material from this "
"course."
msgstr ""
"Prenez un moment pour réfléchir. Les recherches montrent qu&#39;une synthèse"
" pertinente vous aidera à mieux comprendre et à retenir la matière de ce "
"cours."

#: feedback.py:43 feedback.py:164
msgid "Excellent"
msgstr "Excellent"

#: feedback.py:43 feedback.py:165
msgid "Good"
msgstr "Bien"

#: feedback.py:43 feedback.py:166
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Moyenne"

#: feedback.py:43 feedback.py:167
msgid "Fair"
msgstr "Correct"

#: feedback.py:43 feedback.py:168
msgid "Poor"
msgstr "Pauvre"

#: feedback.py:78
msgid "Freeform user prompt"
msgstr "Texte libre saisi par l’utilisateur"

